abstract: >-
  Version 1.6.0 presents a proposed effective proof of Akwei's Conjecture 7.7
  for exactly Definition 7.2's noncyclic pair-moment relaxation. The proposed
  bounds are sqrt(N) + (2 sqrt(2)/3) N^(1/4) - 2572 and
  sqrt(N) + (2 sqrt(2)/3) N^(1/4) + 1 for every integer N >= 2^60.
  Full proof, manuscript PDF and TeX, two separate internal AI-assisted
  mathematical reviews, objection resolutions and bounded novelty audits
  accompany the release. External human verification and peer review remain
  pending; this is not a Lean-verified proof. The conjecture and construction
  are attributed to Akwei, and the upper companion uses Chen's energy bound.
  Earlier exact certificates, checkers and releases are preserved unchanged,
  including v1.5.0's strict coefficient 0.942809069680. No new physical Sidon
  coefficient, Sidon-set construction, worldwide priority or solution of
  Erdos Problem 30 is claimed. AI assistance in drafting and review is
  disclosed. The reference below identifies the existing release series.
keywords:
  - Sidon sets
  - additive combinatorics
  - exact rational certificate
  - computer-assisted proof
  - Mathematical Integrity System
